  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The compound (I) will show the&nbsp;highest dipole moment. It will have maximum charge separation. The dipole moment is the product of the&nbsp;magnitude of charge and distance between two charges.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/rbzzriewnymylykwrfannpccddsqvjpymextsbrrjewpoqvauf.jpeg\" style=\"width: 240px; height: 86px;\" /><br />The quasi aromatic ring is aromatic due to charge delocalization.</p>",
